abstract: >-
  Open-source research software for geometric comparison of finite rigid
  skull-base instrument corridors, with explicit aperture constraints,
  retained trajectories, coverage sets, and unavailable-anatomy states.
  Distributed as the corridorkit Python package and command-line tools.
